  >>> x = tf.constant([[1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6]])
  >>> tf.transpose(x)
  <tf.Tensor: shape=(3, 2), dtype=int32, numpy=
  array([[1, 4],
         [2, 5],
         [3, 6]], dtype=int32)>

  Equivalently, you could call `tf.transpose(x, perm=[1, 0])`.

